                    136.0,
                    233.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. All disciplinary and adverse actions will be done IAW TPR 752.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                265,
                844,
                294
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    265.0
                ],
                [
                    844.0,
                    265.0
                ],
                [
                    844.0,
                    294.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    294.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. This Article applies to matters of  $ \\underline{\\text{conduct}} $ only; actions that relate to  $ \\underline{\\text{job}} $  $ \\underline{\\text{performance}} $ will be accomplished in accordance with the Agency's performance appraisal system.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                321,
                1010,
                407
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    321.0
                ],
                [
                    1010.0,
                    321.0
                ],
                [
                    1010.0,
                    407.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    407.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The purpose of the discipline and adverse action program is to maintain control and order within the workforce by requiring compliance with established rules and regulations. Disciplinary actions will normally be taken using the concept of progressive discipline. While the concept of progressive discipline is the general rule, there may be times or circumstances when the Technician's behavior is such that a more severe punishment is required for the first offense. Supervisors will proactively address unacceptable behavior at the earliest and lowest level of discipline possible. However, this does not inhibit Management's right to choose a higher level of discipline as appropriate.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                432,
                1071,
                686
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    432.0
                ],
                [
                    1071.0,
                    432.0
                ],
                [
                    1071.0,
                    686.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    686.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Technicians are expected to behave appropriately and follow all applicable rules and regulations.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                710,
                1078,
                767
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    131.0,
                    710.0
                ],
                [
                    1078.0,
                    710.0
                ],
                [
                    1078.0,
                    767.0
                ],
                [
                    131.0,
                    767.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. The Employer shall determine when the need for disciplinary action occurs and such actions will be administered in a fair, impartial, and timely manner in accordance with applicable laws and regulations.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                793,
                1076,
                879
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    130.0,
                    793.0
                ],
                [
                    1076.0,
                    793.0
                ],
                [
                    1076.0,
                    879.0
                ],
                [
                    130.0,
                    879.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. The initiation of a disciplinary action against an Employee should not be unreasonably delayed. Some examples of a reasonable delay may include pending investigations or unexpected work schedule conflicts of short duration. Management agrees that in order for the discipline to be effective it must be timely.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                904,
                1040,
                1019
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    904.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    904.0
                ],
                [
                    1040.0,
                    1019.0
                ],
                [
                    129.0,
                    1019.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7. In those situations where an original decision may be delayed, the Employee and/or their representative (if known) will be notified stating the reason for the delay and the anticipated decision date.",
            "block_bbox": [
                129,
                1043,
                1069,
                1128
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    129.0,
                    1043.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
                    1043.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
